    "content": "Recent actions by Iran's judiciary have sparked growing concerns regarding potential political instability in the country. Observers note that these developments could significantly impact domestic political dynamics, potentially influencing future leadership shifts and shaping market perceptions. Analysts are closely monitoring how the situation unfolds and its broader implications.",
