    "id": "a01c02dea21a6ab8",
    "title": "Crypto King Spent $16.3 Million Of Investor Funds On Luxury Lifestyle, Court Hears",
    "summary": "TL;DR: A Canadian court has heard evidence that self-described Crypto King Aiden Pleterski spent about $16.3 million of investor money on personal expenses. He has pleaded not guilty, and the criminal trial remains ongoing. A Canadian court has heard striking testimony about luxury spending allegedly financed by money entrusted to a self-described cryptocurrency trading expert. […]",
    "hasSummary": true,
    "link": "https://bitcoinist.com/crypto-king-spent-16-3-million-of-investor-funds-on-luxury-lifestyle-c/",
    "source": "Bitcoinist",
    "tags": [
      "Aiden Pleterski",
      "Canada"
    ],
    "origin": "rss",
    "pubDate": "2026-10-17T17:43:00.000Z",
    "fetchedAt": "2026-10-17T18:01:18.290Z",
    "isDuplicateOf": null,
    "content": "A Canadian court has heard evidence that self-described Crypto King Aiden Pleterski spent approximately $16.3 million of investor funds on a luxury lifestyle and personal expenses. The trial is currently ongoing, and Pleterski has pleaded not guilty to the charges against him as legal proceedings continue.",
    "content_ta": "கனடா நீதிமன்றத்தில் நடைபெற்ற விசாரணையில், தன்னை Crypto King என்று அழைத்துக்கொண்ட Aiden Pleterski, முதலீட்டாளர்களின் நிதியிலிருந்து சுமார் 16.3 மில்லியன் டாலர்களை ஆடம்பர வாழ்க்கைக்காகவும் சொந்தச் செலவுகளுக்காகவும் செலவழித்ததாகத் தெரிவிக்கப்பட்டுள்ளது. இந்த வழக்கு விசாரணை தொடர்ந்து நடைபெற்று வரும் நிலையில், தன் மீதான குற்றச்சாட்டுகளை Pleterski மறுத்துள்ளார்.",
    "slug": "crypto-king-spent-16-3-million-of-investor-funds-on-luxury-lifestyle-court-hears"
